"entity": {
"name": "Voya Financial, Inc.",
"description": "Voya Financial, Inc. is a retirement, investment, and insurance company, which engages in the provision of financial services. It operates through the following segments: Retirement, Employee Benefits, and Investment Management. The Retirement segment provides employer-sponsored retirement plans, administrative services, stable value products, individual retirement accounts (IRAs), and related financial services. The Employee Benefits segment offers stop-loss, life, disability, and voluntary insurance products, health savings and spending accounts, and benefits administration solutions. The Investment Management segment manages public and private fixed income, equities, multi-asset, and alternative investment strategies for institutions, financial intermediaries, and individual investors. The company was founded on April 7, 1999, and is headquartered in New York, NY.",
